    "claims": [
      "Distributes master data automatically to other companies, databases or third-party systems",
      "Supports a central master data setup feeding country databases",
      "Can connect to e-commerce, customs, shipping portals and labeling systems",
      "Imports and exports contacts, customers and opportunities with a CRM",
      "Monitors data changes field by field and transfers them in the background",
      "Field protection blocks unwanted user changes to synced data",
      "Logging through to the target, deep monitoring and an optional test mode",
      "Set up via a wizard with quick-start templates, no programming",
      "Custom message types can be defined; ready-made setups available from the Yaveon shop",
      "Supports XML, CSV, JSON and flat-file formats",
      "Works with BC Essentials and Premium"
